      en: ["The Majapahit Empire reached its peak under King Hayam Wuruk and Gajah Mada.", "Trowulan was an urban complex covering approximately 100 square kilometers.", "The Segaran Pool is a massive ancient reservoir measuring 800 x 500 meters.", "Bajang Ratu is an elegant 16.5-meter tall brick gateway from the 14th century.", "Archaeologists have found evidence of sophisticated underground brick sewers.", "The site was described in detail in the 1365 poem 'Desawarnana'.", "Thousands of terracotta figurines have been unearthed, showing daily life.", "Trowulan is currently on the UNESCO World Heritage Tentative List."]
