      en: ["The oldest Hindu temples on Java, dating back to the 7th century.", "The 'Arjuna' cluster is the most well-preserved group of temples.", "Candi Bima features unique architecture with Indian-style 'shikhara' roofs.", "The plateau is a massive volcanic caldera with active vents and craters.", "Experiences some of the coldest temperatures on Java, including frost in winter.", "Once home to over 400 temples, most of which were destroyed by natural disasters.", "Telaga Warna (Colorful Lake) is located nearby, known for its sulfur-rich waters.", "The temples were designed with drainage systems to handle the heavy mountain rain."]
